<title>GERMANY: Didier-Werke to boost 1997 profit, dividend.</title>
<headline>Didier-Werke to boost 1997 profit, dividend.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>German fireproofing maker Didier-Werke said it expects to boost its group and parent profit in 1997 from last year's levels, and to pay a higher dividend.</p>
<p>Chairman Dietrich von Knoop told journalists cost cuts as well as favourable developments in the iron and steel industry should help boost profit.</p>
<p>Didier posted an 18.5 million mark profit in 1996 on sales of 1.289 billion marks. It paid a two mark dividend.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom, 49-69-7565-1213</p>
